@bank dept:works
// Head writer W (playtest 1, 0.63.2; seat T's Name on the Beam). Works crew round the beam. beam.congrats: said to
// you after your name goes up (a bubble or card, 60 characters). beam.cheer: for another new Works member whose name
// just went up (a rotation arrival; {other} is them). Then everyone disbands.

== beam.congrats
- Welcome to Works, {me}. Properly, now.   #warm
- Lovely letters. That's there for good.
- Another name on the beam! Welcome aboard.   #warm
- You're one of us now. No take-backs.   #funny
- Good name. Good spot. Welcome, {me}.
- Ha! Neater than mine. Welcome to the bay.   #funny

== beam.cheer
- Welcome to Works, {other}!   #warm
- Another name on the beam. Welcome aboard.
- Good letters, {other}. Welcome to the bay.
- That's you up there now. No take-backs.   #funny
